-- CONTRACT --------------- errors/pure_violation_3.march

`wrapped` in `mod Pure` (declared `cap pure`) calls `System.monotonic_time`, which has side effects: it reaches `sys_uptime_ms`. [pure_violation]

Use pure functions (no IO, spawn, vault, clock, or random ops) in a `cap pure` module.

